<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 852 0 R
/E (In daily life, people struggle to find reliable nearby service providers quickly. Traditional search methods \(local shops, word-of-mouth\) are slow and lack transparency in pricing and availability. Service providers also lack a digital presence to reach customers efficiently.)
/Pg 10 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
276 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 853 0 R
